 "prompt": "Make a hiring pipeline board: Applied, Interview, Offer and Hired columns with a count each, cards with the candidate, a tag, an avatar and a date. Tapping a card moves it to the next stage. Show all columns on a tablet and one at a time with tabs on a phone.",
